note: The op amp in the circuit shown in the figure is ideal. a) Calculate v_o if v_a = 1 V and v_b = 0 V. b) Repeat (a) for v_a = 1 V and v_b = 2 V. c) If v_a = 1.5 V, specify the range of v_b that avoids amplifier saturation.
